WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.823
Erdős's progressions problem.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.353
If reciprocals sum to infinity, must a set

3
00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:07.587
hold evenly spaced runs of every length?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.833
No run means a denser piece. Zoom

5
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.866
in and repeat until one must appear.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.928
Claimed: yes, for every length.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.208
Lean covers only part.
